]
}
; B/Circle. "B closes this" is still true in every menu in the game -- what
; changed is that B carries the DODGE in the world again (see `context`). The
; two never collide, because a menu that is up has either paused the tree or
; raised Prompt.blocked, and the hero does not read his buttons through either.
;
; The empty-face-button argument that used to live here was real but it was
; bought with the wrong coin: it cost the dodge its own button and put it on
; top of `interact`, so the most reaction-critical press in the game had to be
; arbitrated against a shopkeeper.
